---
// src/components/storefront/BrandStory.astro
---

<section class="w-full overflow-hidden bg-base py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 sm:gap-12 md:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      
      <div class="relative order-2 md:order-1 md:col-span-5">
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 -left-6 sm:-top-16 sm:-left-12 font-mono text-[8rem] sm:text-[12rem] font-bold text-content/[0.02] select-none"
        >
          34%
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10 pl-2 sm:pl-0">
          <span
            class="mb-2 sm:mb-4 block font-mono text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content lg:text-7xl"
            >34<span class="text-brand">%</span></span
          >
          <p
            class="max-w-[180px] sm:max-w-[200px] font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-content-muted uppercase leading-relaxed"
          >
            Average customer savings across all categories since launch.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="order-1 md:order-2 md:col-span-7">
        <h2
          class="mb-5 sm:mb-8 text-2xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tight text-content sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl"
        >
          Built for people who refuse to overpay.
        </h2>
        <div
          class="max-w-xl space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted"
        >
          <p>
            Symeno wasn't founded by retailers. It was founded by analysts who
            realized that global supply chain efficiencies were never reaching
            the end customer.
          </p>
          <p>
            We operate on a simple thesis: Volume is power. By aggregating
            demand and negotiating bulk positions with authorized brand
            partners, we can collapse the retail margin.
          </p>
          <p>
            We don't do flash sales. We don't do fake timers. We provide the
            structural best price, every single day.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 sm:mt-10">
          <a
            href="/about"
            class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-brand/40 pb-1 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-content transition-colors hover:border-brand focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand"
          >
            Our Sourcing Ethics <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>